{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"逆顺 - 标签","description":"Hugo FixIt 作者，喜欢瞎折腾、造轮子、写东西，分享一些前端开发中的所见、所闻、所思。","home_page_url":"https://lruihao.cn/","language":"zh-CN","icon":"https://lruihao.cn/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://lruihao.cn/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.png"}],"items":[{"title":"逆顺第五十五","date_published":"2025-09-14T16:20:11&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-08-25T12:52:26Z","id":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/lingshu-55/","url":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/lingshu-55/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://gravatar.loli.net/avatar/89719985bb81a6f9d508808413f1b999?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["逆顺"],"summary":"逆顺，系指反常与正常，既指气行的逆顺，又含针刺的逆与顺。因文中主要论述了人体出现气血逆乱后，针刺方法运用的逆与顺，故称为\u0026quot;逆顺\u0026quot;。","content_html":"逆顺，系指反常与正常，既指气行的逆顺，又含针刺的逆与顺。因文中主要论述了人体出现气血逆乱后，针刺方法运用的逆与顺，故称为\u0026quot;逆顺\u0026quot;。"}]}